The control panels are translated like `@plone/plate`: `ControlPanelsProvider` takes a `t` function in react-i18next's shape instead of `translate`, apps on react-intl pass `translationFromIntl(intl)`, and the messages use `{{placeholder}}`s. The translations ship in `src/locales`, in English, German, Spanish, Italian and Catalan, and load in Plone Aurora with the add-on. `pnpm i18n` updates the English catalog from the code. @sneridagh
